 ("Dermoscopy of DLE.", ["Active: perifollicular whitish halo, follicular keratotic plugs (yellow-red dots), arborising/ linear vessels, white scales", "Late: white structureless scarring areas, loss of follicular openings, pigmentation (speckled brown/ blue-grey dots)", "Scalp DLE: large yellow dots with thin arborising vessels (red spider in yellow dot)"]),
